
# Step 1: Narrow Down the Scope

Don't try to build a full smart parking system. Focus on these two core modules:

### Module A: Green Parking Optimizer

Predict and recommend the best parking area based on:

* Time
* Day
* Occupancy level
* Walking distance

### Module B: AI Memory Assistant

Allow users to:

* Save parking notes
* Retrieve parking location using natural language

---

# Step 2: Map AI Techniques to Features

You need at least 3 techniques.

| Requirement        | Implementation                                                          |
| ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| NLP                | Extract location information from parking notes                         |
| Transformer Model  | Fine-tuned BERT for extracting parking entities (zone, floor, landmark) |
| Generative AI      | Generate parking recommendations and summaries                          |
| Prompt Engineering | Create structured prompts for recommendation generation                 |

This already satisfies the assignment.

---

# Step 3: Define Your Research Problem

A good problem statement could be:

> Drivers waste time and fuel searching for parking spaces, contributing to congestion and carbon emissions. Additionally, many drivers struggle to remember where they parked in large parking facilities. This project proposes an AI-powered parking assistant that predicts optimal parking locations while providing intelligent parking memory support.

---

# Step 4: Find Datasets

## Parking Occupancy Dataset

Search Kaggle for:

* Smart Parking Dataset
* Parking Occupancy Prediction Dataset
* Parking Birmingham Dataset

Useful search terms:

* "parking occupancy"
* "smart parking"
* "parking prediction"

These datasets typically contain:

* Timestamp
* Occupancy
* Parking lot ID

Perfect for prediction.

---

## NLP Dataset for Memory Assistant

You can create your own.

Example:

| User Note                      | Zone | Floor | Landmark             |
| ------------------------------ | ---- | ----- | -------------------- |
| Near blue pillar in Zone A     | A    | -     | blue pillar          |
| Level 2 beside elevator        | -    | 2     | elevator             |
| Near Engineering Building gate | -    | -     | Engineering Building |

100–300 examples are enough for a course project.

