# Features That Will Impress Evaluators

### CO₂ Savings Calculator

Show:

```text
Normal parking search:
8 min

GreenPark AI:
3 min

Estimated CO₂ saved:
110 g
```

### Parking Habit Insights

Example:

> You typically arrive between 8:00–8:30 AM on weekdays. Parking availability increases significantly before 7:50 AM.

### Voice Parking Notes

User says:

> I parked near the library entrance beside the red pillar.

AI stores structured information automatically.

